# flamapy

The flamapy feature-model distribution: a meta-package that installs the
framework and the feature-model analysis plugins, and provides the command-line
interface and the easy-to-use Python facade (`FLAMAFeatureModel`).

**Documentation:** https://docs.flamapy.org

## Installation

```bash
pip install flamapy
```
